@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = paste-your-access-token-here

### 我的通知列表 + 各类型未读数（登录即可，按用户隔离）
GET {{host}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 单条标为已读
PATCH {{host}}/notifications/some-notification-id/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 全部标为已读（可带 type 限定 NOTICE/MESSAGE/TODO）
POST {{host}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 清空已读（软删除；可带 query type 限定）
DELETE {{host}}/notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
